clude facts for all candidates. We should discuss maybe Candidate B's stress handling and conscientiousness, or Candidate D's responsibility, or Candidate A's anticipation and leadership. We need to make a focused argumentative contribution, include our current vote, and reference evidence.\n\nWe can either agree with Candidate C or propose another candidate. Let's evaluate: Candidate C has reliability and decision quality, but communication difficulty and egocentric, not willing to further education. Candidate B has very conscientious (reliability), handles stress well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical competence), excellent computer skills (technical). Concerns: pretentious, sometimes wrong tone (communication). Candidate D has responsibility, problem solving, concentration, handles unexpected events, but moody, loner (crew cooperation). Candidate A has anticipation, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership, but unfriendly, unhealthy eating (maybe health concerns). For long-distance pilot, stress resilience and technical competence are crucial, plus crew cooperation and communication. Candidate B seems strong on stress and technical, but communication concerns. Candidate C strong on reliability and decision, but communication and adaptability concerns. Which is stronger overall? Might be B.\n\nWe can argue that while Candidate C's reliability is excellent, the communication difficulty and lack of adaptability are serious for cockpit environment, especially long flights where feedback and crew coordination matter. Candidate B's stress handling and conscientiousness address reliability and stress, and while he can be pretentious and sometimes wrong tone, that may be mitigated with training. So we could shift vote to Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference our own facts: B is very conscientious, handles stress very well, good at assessing weather conditions, excellent computer skills. Also B is regarded as pretentious, sometimes adopts wrong tone. Provide implication.\n\nThus we can say we now recommend Candidate B, because stress resilience and technical competence are critical, and his conscientiousness ensures reliability, while communication concerns are less severe than C's egocentric and unwillingness to further education.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
